# One line ending, decided rather than drifted into.
#
# The repo was CRLF because it started on Windows, and successive edit scripts
# rewrote files as LF a few at a time, so it ended up twelve one way and
# twenty eight the other. Lua and Python do not care, but a whole-file diff
# every time a line ending flips buries the two lines that actually changed.
#
# LF everywhere, normalised on commit. Nothing here needs CRLF: UE4SS reads
# the Lua, python reads the tools, and both are happy either way.
* text=auto eol=lf
